110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-eHynO36sr8Q7kNvwF_4nj6&_nc_oc=AdoB_8G3F-gTTwei-rgmjLmOmVGbXnNpvCX5kgpxaM7laPG1QyI5sDFgBoX4-C3XvqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSZRGVDzXNiUI4M3ed3oogrfTD3JOep8XvM5KqTFRWNEw&oe=6AFC7D5E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_5.png", "id": "1080574004882450", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673645340_1080574008215783_4700382301956358895_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ktqgYU85I5oQ7kNvwGOmwZz&_nc_oc=AdqMtHZ4cDTtFl4bHUIAY5t8b8h_UFuaZMKPNcMRbloV9srvV56oXyBf8t0t9ZdX7ok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzJ4VC3288_Orp-FRFq_iQBX8hZoj5rd4pOeC0znIDZw&oe=6AFC9349"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover.png", "id": "4474187666187659", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673716021_4474187669520992_1715563834384829406_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j6XQkXdWshYQ7kNvwFeOjji&_nc_oc=Adr4KH4ps1KCf-nZjydkk6SmADNfdncG1vvqGWgKIRVxl40cLqeGia7f7JhV8z0D40k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5ES9S__0oEH-q4yf9xg3o5ygN9hAH4kRvVWOqXc2ZZQ&oe=6AFC88C2"}, "display_name": "Race NYC Online", "keywords": ["racing", "multiplayer", "driving", "cars", "city"], "long_description": "New York never sleeps. Now you race it together.\n\nRACE ONLINE\nQuick Play drops you into a room with up to 8 drivers, or open a private room with a 4-digit code for friends. The host starts a race, or Auto Races rotate the events, and everyone lines up on one grid. The lights go out together, places update live, and results feed a session championship.\n\nDRIVERS YOU CAN SEE\nPick your car, your paint and one of 12 drivers. Everyone sits at the wheel and moves with their real head and hands - look across, wave, then take the lead.\n\nSIX ONLINE EVENTS\nFDR Sprint, Crosstown Dash, West Side Run, the Manhattan Loop, King of New York over two laps, and the Near Miss Battle in rush-hour traffic. AI crews fill the grid so two friends still get a full race.\n\nTHE REAL MANHATTAN\nAbout 20,000 real buildings at their real heights, the real bridges, Times Square and both rivers, lit up at night.\n\nTRAFFIC, NEAR MISSES, NITRO, SLIPSTREAM\nThread taxis and buses for near misses, chain them up to x10 and fire the nitro. Tuck in behind any car for a slipstream.\n\nTHE FULL SOLO GAME\nThe Night Ladder career (10 events, 30 stars), quick races against three crews, police chases and free ride.\n\nVoice chat is optional and off by default. Mute, block and report any driver.", "short_description": "Race your friends through the real New York at midnight. Up to 8 drivers line up on one grid on a 17 km lap of Manhattan built from real map data - up the FDR Drive under the bridges, through Times Square, down the West Side Highway. Every car has its driver at the wheel, moving with that player's head and hands. Live places, session points, AI crews to fill the grid, near misses, nitro and slipstream - online, or solo with the full career."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/racenyconline/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/racenyconline/", "website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/racenyconline/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_